^CONVERSION ERROR$
--
A class with a user-provided constructor is not an aggregate, so a
braced-init-list invokes a constructor rather than member-wise aggregate
initialization.  A converting constructor taking a reference to another type
(e.g. Wrap(int&)) must not be treated as a copy/move constructor.
